{
  "declaredLength": 2524,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 아이들은\n쓰레기봉투포켓몬인 깨봉이인데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C544C774B4E4C740000AC4F0B808AE30BD09D22CD3ECCF13BAACC7780020AE68BD09C774C778B370C694002E002E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희 카페의 음식물 쓰레기가\n마음에 들었는지<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n가게에 모여들게 됐어요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76C0020CE74D398C7580020C74CC2DDBB3C0020C4F0B808AE30AC00000AB9C8C74CC5D00020B4E4C5C8B294C9C000100001BE00000AAC00AC8CC5D00020BAA8C5ECB4E4AC8C0020B410C5B4C694002E002E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보옹~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C639007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님들만이 아니라\n깨봉이들에게도 사랑받는 건 기쁘지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n깨봉이의 냄새를 싫어하는 사람도 있어서\n손님이 줄어 버렸단 말이죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C00021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희 가게의 음식물 쓰레기를 노리는 거라면\n그걸 활용하면 되겠네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76C0020AC00AC8CC7580020C74CC2DDBB3C0020C4F0B808AE30B97C0020B178B9ACB2940020AC70B77CBA74000AADF8AC780020D65CC6A9D558BA740020B418ACA0B124C6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희 가게의 음식물 쓰레기...\n맛있는쓰레기로 깨봉이들을 쓰레기장까지<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n데려가 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76C0020AC00AC8CC7580020C74CC2DDBB3C0020C4F0B808AE30002E002E002E000AB9DBC788B294C4F0B808AE30B85C0020AE68BD09C774B4E4C7440020C4F0B808AE30C7A5AE4CC9C000100001BE00000AB370B824AC000020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 다 되면 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B2E40020B418BA740020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오늘은 배틀 존에 걸렸네요...\n깨봉이는 내일 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B298C7400020BC30D2C00020C874C5D00020AC78B838B124C694002E002E002E000AAE68BD09C774B2940020B0B4C77C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰레기장까지\n깨봉이를 데려가 주셨으면 해요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n준비되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B808AE30C7A5AE4CC9C0000AAE68BD09C774B97C0020B370B824AC000020C8FCC168C73CBA740020D574C694002E00100001BE00000AC900BE44B418C168B098C694003F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비됐어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B410C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 가게 일에서\n손을 뗄 수가 없는데 어쩌죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020AC00AC8C0020C77CC5D0C11C000AC190C7440020B5C40020C218AC000020C5C6B294B3700020C5B4CA4CC8E0002E002E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 고마워요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020ACE0B9C8C6CCC6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이걸 가지고 있으면\n깨봉이가 쓰레기장까지 따라가 줄 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC780020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C73CBA74000AAE68BD09C774AC000020C4F0B808AE30C7A5AE4CC9C00020B530B77CAC000020C9040020AC70C608C694002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨봉이가 잘 따라갈 수 있게\n천천히 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BD09C774AC000020C7980020B530B77CAC080020C2180020C788AC8C000ACC9CCC9CD7880020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰레기장은 이 길을 곧장 따라가면 있어요!\n그럼, 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B808AE30C7A5C7400020C7740020AE38C7440020ACE7C7A50020B530B77CAC00BA740020C788C5B4C6940021000AADF8B7FC002C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 길을 곧장 따라가면 있는 막다른 곳에\n맛있는쓰레기를 두고 와 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020AE38C7440020ACE7C7A50020B530B77CAC00BA740020C788B2940020B9C9B2E4B9780020ACF3C5D0000AB9DBC788B294C4F0B808AE30B97C0020B450ACE00020C6400020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "길을 곧장 따라가면 있는 막다른 곳까지\n깨봉이를 데려가자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE38C7440020ACE7C7A50020B530B77CAC00BA740020C788B2940020B9C9B2E4B9780020ACF3AE4CC9C0000AAE68BD09C774B97C0020B370B824AC00C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰레기장에\n맛있는쓰레기를 두겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B808AE30C7A5C5D0000AB9DBC788B294C4F0B808AE30B97C0020B450ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨보옹~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BCF4C639007E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨봉이들은\n정신없이 맛있는쓰레기를 먹고 있다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BD09C774B4E4C740000AC815C2E0C5C6C7740020B9DBC788B294C4F0B808AE30B97C0020BA39ACE00020C788B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰레기를 옮겨 줘서 고마워요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B808AE30B97C0020C62EACA80020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CCC6940021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기라면 깨봉이들의 냄새가\n카페까지 풍기지 않을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30B77CBA740020AE68BD09C774B4E4C7580020B0C4C0C8AC00000ACE74D398AE4CC9C00020D48DAE30C9C00020C54AC7440020AC70C608C694002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨봉이들...\n정말 맛있게 먹네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BD09C774B4E4002E002E002E000AC815B9D00020B9DBC788AC8C0020BA39B124C694002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "생각해 봤는데요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n바로 옆에 있는 것만이\n포켓몬과 함께 사는 건 아닌 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0DDAC01D5740020BD24B294B370C694002E002E002E00100001BE01000ABC14B85C0020C606C5D00020C788B2940020AC83B9CCC774000AD3ECCF13BAACACFC0020D568AED80020C0ACB2940020AC740020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19C544C694002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨봉이들이 저희 가게 음식을 좋아하지만\n가게에서 먹게 할 수는 없는 것처럼요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BD09C774B4E4C7740020C800D76C0020AC00AC8C0020C74CC2DDC7440020C88BC544D558C9C0B9CC000AAC00AC8CC5D0C11C0020BA39AC8C0020D5600020C218B2940020C5C6B2940020AC83CC98B7FCC694002E002E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이렇게 서로 적절한 거리를 찾아 가는 것도\n포켓몬과 공생하는 한 가지 형태인 거겠죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B807AC8C0020C11CB85C0020C801C808D55C0020AC70B9ACB97C0020CC3EC5440020AC00B2940020AC83B3C4000AD3ECCF13BAACACFC0020ACF5C0DDD558B2940020D55C0020AC00C9C00020D615D0DCC7780020AC70ACA0C8E0003F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이 따라다니는 것뿐인데\n너무 귀여워...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B530B77CB2E4B2C8B2940020AC83BFD0C778B370000AB108BB340020ADC0C5ECC6CC002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머?\n조금 자극적인 스멜이네...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38003F000AC870AE080020C790ADF9C801C7780020C2A4BA5CC774B124002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대여르 같아!\n힘들어 보이지만 파이팅!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C5ECB9740020AC19C5440021000AD798B4E4C5B40020BCF4C774C9C0B9CC0020D30CC774D30500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러고 보니 깨봉이는\n쓰레기를 먹어 치워 주지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECACE00020BCF4B2C80020AE68BD09C774B294000AC4F0B808AE30B97C0020BA39C5B40020CE58C6CC0020C8FCC9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깨봉이와의 작은 여행을\n무사히 끝마친 모양이네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE68BD09C774C640C7580020C791C7400020C5ECD589C744000ABB34C0ACD7880020B05DB9C8CE5C0020BAA8C591C774B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    }
  ],
